        "content": "<div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f1923,#1a2332);padding:16px 24px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #ff8800'><div style='color:#ff8800;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold'>⚡ Cross-Domain Impact Analysis</div><div style='color:#aaa;margin-top:6px;font-size:13px'>How a poorly written job cascades: Job resource abuse → NCCL socket storm → Network congestion → GPU unavailability → Capacity loss</div><div style='display:flex;gap:24px;margin-top:10px;font-size:11px'><span style='color:#7ee787'>● Healthy state</span><span style='color:#f0c040'>● Warning threshold</span><span style='color:#ff7b72'>● Critical / cascading failure</span></div></div>",
